; name: Drawer box
; group: Boxes & casework
; description: A drawer box in 12 mm plywood, nested on a 1220 × 610 sheet: two sides with dados for the front and back, a groove all round for a 6 mm bottom, cut out with tabs. Change drawerW / drawerD / drawerH and the material in the variables; the bottom is cut from a 6 mm sheet (switch its operation on for that sheet).
; 
